<section class="container" style="font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left;"><h1 class="h1" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 1em; border-bottom: 2px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em auto 1em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: 0 !important;">中国AI模型调用量首次超越美国，全球前五占据四席</h1><blockquote class="blockquote" style="font-style: normal; padding: 1em; border-left: 4px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 6px; color: #3f3f3f; background: #f7f7f7; margin-bottom: 1em;"><p class="p" style="display: block; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f; margin: 0;">2026年2月，全球AI格局迎来历史性转折点：中国AI模型在OpenRouter平台的调用量首次超越美国，全球前五名中中国占据四席。这不仅是数字上的超越，更是中国AI产业从追赶到并跑，再到领跑的关键一步。</p></blockquote><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">📊 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">历史性超越：中国AI的&quot;二月奇迹&quot;</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">根据全球最大的AI模型API聚合平台OpenRouter数据显示，2026年2月9日至15日这一周，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">中国模型以4.12万亿Token的调用量，首次超过同期美国模型的2.94万亿Token</strong>。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">更令人振奋的是，到2月16日至22日这一周，中国模型的周调用量进一步冲高至<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">5.16万亿Token</strong>，三周时间增长127%，而同期美国模型调用量跌至2.7万亿Token。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">全球调用量排名前五的模型中，中国模型占据四席：</strong></p><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">MiniMax M2.5</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">月之暗面 Kimi K2.5  </li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">智谱 GLM-5</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">DeepSeek V3.2</li></ol><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">这四款模型合计贡献了Top5总调用量的85.7%，展现了中国AI厂商的集群式崛起。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">💰 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">性价比革命：成本优势高达16.7倍</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">中国AI模型能够迅速占领全球市场，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">极致的性价比</strong>是关键因素：</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">输入成本对比：</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• MiniMax M2.5：0.3美元/百万Token</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 智谱 GLM-5：0.3美元/百万Token  </li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Claude Opus 4.6：5美元/百万Token</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">中国模型成本仅为Claude的1/16.7！</strong></p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">输出成本对比：</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• MiniMax M2.5：1.1美元/百万Token</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 智谱 GLM-5：2.55美元/百万Token</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Claude Opus 4.6：25美元/百万Token</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">成本优势高达22.7倍！</strong></p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🔧 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">技术突破：MoE架构的降本增效</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">中国AI模型能够实现如此惊人的性价比，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">混合专家（Mixture-of-Experts, MoE）架构</strong>是核心技术突破：</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">MoE架构的工作原理：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">专家网络拆分</strong>：将大模型拆分为多个相对较小的&quot;专家网络&quot;</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">门控网络调度</strong>：智能判断任务性质，只激活相关专家网络</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">按需激活</strong>：避免&quot;全体动员&quot;，大幅减少计算量</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">技术优势：</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">显存占用降低60%</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">推理吞吐量提升19倍</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">计算效率大幅提升</strong></li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">目前，包括DeepSeek、阿里巴巴通义千问等模型都已广泛采用MoE架构，从技术源头上实现了降本增效。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🌍 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">全球认可：硅谷80%初创公司使用中国模型</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">知名风险投资机构Andreessen Horowitz（a16z）的合伙人Martin Casado观察到，<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">如今在硅谷寻求融资的AI初创公司中，其路演核心模型高达80%使用中国的开源模型</strong>。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">OpenRouter平台的用户构成更能说明问题：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">美国用户占比</strong>：47.17%</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">中国开发者占比</strong>：仅6.01%</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">这意味着，中国AI模型主要被<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">海外开发者</strong>使用，其受欢迎程度是真实的市场选择结果。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🚀 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">应用范式转变：从&quot;问答&quot;到&quot;干活&quot;</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">Token调用量的爆发式增长，背后是AI应用范式的根本性转变：</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">三大核心趋势：</strong></h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">1. 从&quot;问答&quot;到&quot;干活&quot;</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 用户需求从浅层问答转向深度工作</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• AI开始重构代码、改写文件、生成文档</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 编程场景天然消耗大量Token</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">2. AI Agent技术兴起</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Agent会主动规划、检索、执行、反思</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 多次调用模型，Token消耗按步骤累加</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 用户愿意&quot;增加Token投入来换取效率&quot;</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">3. 推理强度上升</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 更多深度思考、更长链路推理</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 提高输出与中间过程的Token消耗</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 带来更高成功率与更少返工</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">📈 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">产业影响：Token从&quot;流量&quot;到&quot;燃料&quot;</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">国联民生证券提出了&quot;Token通胀&quot;概念，这并非指Token变贵，而是<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">单位时间内、单位用户的Token消耗结构性上升</strong>。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">英伟达CEO黄仁勋</strong>在业绩电话会上反复强调：&quot;计算即收入&quot;&quot;推理即收入&quot;。没有算力，就无法生成Token；没有Token，就无法带来收入增长。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">在AI时代，Token不再是传统互联网时代边际成本几乎为零的&quot;流量&quot;，而是执行生产任务时必不可少的&quot;燃料&quot;。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🔮 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">未来展望：AI服务的商业模式演进</strong></h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">商业模式转变：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">从&quot;按量计费&quot;到&quot;燃料+成果&quot;混合模式</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">Token单价持续下降</strong>（技术进步+规模效应）</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">企业更愿为&quot;成果&quot;付费</strong>（催生订阅制模式）</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">定价体系变革：</strong></h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">高度定制化和灵活化</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">多维度、动态定价体系</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">计算消耗、调用频次、任务复杂度</strong>都将影响定价</li></ul><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">💡 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">对中国AI产业的启示</strong></h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">成功因素：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">技术突破</strong>：MoE架构等技术创新</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">成本优势</strong>：极致的性价比</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">开源策略</strong>：赢得全球开发者认可</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">垂直整合</strong>：软硬件协同优化</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">未来挑战：</strong></h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">持续创新</strong>：保持技术领先优势</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">生态建设</strong>：构建完整的AI产业链</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">国际化</strong>：进一步拓展全球市场</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">安全可控</strong>：确保AI技术健康发展</li></ol><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">🌟 <strong class="strong" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit; color: inherit !important;">结语</strong></h2><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">中国AI模型调用量首次超越美国，这不仅是数字上的胜利，更是<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">中国AI产业从技术追赶到市场引领的标志性事件</strong>。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">从&quot;百模大战&quot;到&quot;四小强&quot;格局，从技术模仿到源头创新，中国AI产业正在走出一条独特的发展道路。<strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">性价比优势+技术创新+开源生态</strong>，这三驾马车正推动中国AI走向世界舞台中央。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">未来已来，中国AI正在重新定义全球AI产业格局。这场没有硝烟的科技竞赛，才刚刚开始。</p><hr class="hr" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;"><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong class="strong" style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">互动话题：</strong></p><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">你使用过哪些中国AI模型？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">你认为中国AI最大的优势是什么？</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">未来AI服务应该采用什么样的定价模式？</li></ol><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">欢迎在评论区分享你的观点！</p>
    
  
    
  
    
